  "description": "HttpClient extensions for .NET. Adds the response-body idle timeout that .NET does not have: a delegating handler that fails a body read once it goes silent for a configured time, without ever cutting a slow transfer that keeps producing data. Works with buffered sends, GetFromJsonAsync and streamed reads, composes with IHttpClientFactory and resilience handlers, and never leaks query strings into error messages.",
